{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 50,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The Mighty One, God, Jehovah, hath spoken,\nAnd called the earth from the rising of the sun unto the going down thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty,\nGod hath shined forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our God cometh, and doth not keep silence:\nA fire devoureth before him,\nAnd it is very tempestuous round about him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He calleth to the heavens above,\nAnd to the earth, that he may judge his people:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gather my saints together unto me,\nThose that have made a covenant with me by sacrifice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the heavens shall declare his righteousness;\nFor God is judge himself. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my people, and I will speak;\nO Israel, and I will testify unto thee:\nI am God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not reprove thee for thy sacrifices;And thy burnt-offerings are continually before me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will take no bullock out of thy house,\nNor he-goats out of thy folds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For every beast of the forest is mine,\nAnd the cattle upon a thousand hills.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I know all the birds of the mountains;\nAnd the wild beasts of the field are mine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I were hungry, I would not tell thee;\nFor the world is mine, and the fulness thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will I eat the flesh of bulls,\nOr drink the blood of goats?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Offer unto God the sacrifice of thanksgiving;\nAnd pay thy vows unto the Most High;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And call upon me in the day of trouble:\nI will deliver thee, and thou shalt glorify me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But unto the wicked God saith,\nWhat hast thou to do to declare my statutes,\nAnd that thou hast taken my covenant in thy mouth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seeing that thou hatest instruction,\nAnd castest my words behind thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou sawest a thief, thou consentedst with him,\nAnd hast been partaker with adulterers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou givest thy mouth to evil,\nAnd thy tongue frameth deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou sittest and speakest against thy brother;\nThou slanderest thine own mother’s son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These things hast thou done, and I kept silence;\nThou thoughtest that I was altogether such a one as thyself:",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I will reprove thee, and set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in order before thine eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now consider this, ye that forget God,\nLest I tear you in pieces, and there be none to deliver:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.50.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso offereth the sacrifice of thanksgiving glorifieth me;\nAnd to him that ordereth his way ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "aright",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nWill I show the salvation of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "God the judge of the righteous and the wicked.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of Asaph.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
